UID:event_314602101@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260521T042442Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260522T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260522T203000
SUMMARY:African Djembe Drumming Class
DESCRIPTION:Live African music and drumming events in NJ\nMondays\, Wednes
 days and Fridays we are open for Djembe classes from 7:30-8:30pm.\n\nLimit
 ed attendees allowed and masks mandatory at all times. Drums are disinfect
 ed before and after use.\n\nFor more info and to attend other events check
  out Issyra Gallery in Hoboken hosting weekly international live music art
  and culture happenings just minutes away from home.\n\nOpen for appointme
 nts also during the week.\n\nIssyra Gallery 300 observer Highway Hoboken N
 J. 5 minutes from Path train - parking available\nIssyragallery@gmail.com\
 nTelephone: 9179222690\nWww. Issyragallery.com\n\nFollow us on Facebook\, 
 Twitter and Instagram
